it, the greater the damage dealt to your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Styles, Endless Thrills!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over hundreds of different bullets and equipment, and more to come in future updates, every run features randomly generated paths and enemies, making each adventure a fresh new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Revenge...... or Redemption?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the gang, some foes are exceptionally formidable - watch out for them, and some of them seem have old scores to settle with you. As you progress through the ride, any deeper schemes hidden beneath it all?</p>","developers":["Good Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607010/42aca92f9d46aed63f49c313ec8eeb5502eecb07/header.jpg?t=1749519730","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153955,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153955/movie480.mp4?t=1749462438","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153955/movie_max.mp4?t=1749462438"},"name":"Pegshot-EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153955/4952922f570bf652561c64b0517b9d3fde09f054/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749462438","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153955/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749462438","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153955/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749462438"}}],"name":"Pegshot: Vendetta","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><l